  "title": "Steel Dynamics Announces Third Quarter 2026 Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "FORT WAYNE, Ind., Aug. 14, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Steel Dynamics, Inc. (NASDAQ/GS: STLD) today announced that the company’s board of directors declared a third quarter cash dividend of $0.53 per common share. The dividend is payable to shareholders of record at the close of business on September 30, 2026, and is payable on or about […]",
